THIRD-PARTY DATASET & MODEL WEIGHTS NOTICE

The pretrained floorplan segmentation model weights (`public/models/floorplan-seg-v1.onnx*`)
were trained on the CubiCasa5K dataset (Kalervo et al., "CubiCasa5K: A Dataset and an
Improved Multi-Task Model for Floorplan Image Analysis", SCIA 2019) and are distributed
under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International License (CC BY-NC 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/
